142 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Functional JTBD\050 When I\047m occupied with work and not physically present in the kitchen\054 I want to be automatically informed before essential grocery items run out\054 so I can reorder in time without disrupting my cook\047s routine or my mealtime\056\050\050\nEmotional JTBD\050 When I repeatedly find out at the last moment that something has run out\054 I want to feel in control of my household without having to actively monitor it\054 so I don\047t carry the background anxiety of \042what\047s going to run out next\042 on top of an already busy day\056\050\050\nSocial JTBD\050 When I am the person my cook and flatmates depend on to manage grocery reordering\054 I want to stay on top of it reliably\054 so I\047m seen as a responsible and organised person running the household \024 not someone who always drops the ball on basic things\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 143 0 R
     /Pg 140 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
